          </h2>

          <p>
            Earth Chimp costs about $2.21 per 25 g of protein in the 2 lb bag and about $1.92 in the 4 lb bag, using the brand's own prices at the time of writing and the 20 g protein figure from its product guide. Using the 21 g figure on the chocolate panel brings the 2 lb bag down to about $2.11. Amazon prices move often and can be lower.
          </p>

          <div class="overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl my-8">
            <div class="overflow-x-auto">
              <table class="w-full text-left">
